{"title": "Soul Catching", "pageid": 18814, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Soul_Catching", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Soul Catching</b> is a passive feature granted to the wearer of the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching\" title=\"Gloves of Soul Catching\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching\" title=\"Gloves of Soul Catching\">Gloves of Soul Catching</a>. After landing an unarmed or throwing attack, the wearer can heal 10 hit points or gain a +5 bonus to a single attack roll or saving throw. Only one of these options can be used each turn.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per turn, on an unarmed hit, you regain <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>. Alternatively, you may forego healing to gain a +5 bonus on an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> until the end of your next turn.<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn</dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Catching_Boon\" title=\"Soul Catching Boon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Buff_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Buff_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Buff_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Buff_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Buff_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Buff_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul Catching Boon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Generic_Buff_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Buff_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Generic_Buff_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Catching_Boon\" title=\"Soul Catching Boon\">Soul Catching Boon</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Catching_Prowess\" title=\"Soul Catching Prowess\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp/40px-Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp/60px-Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp/80px-Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul Catching Prowess\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp/40px-Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dd/Soul_Catching_Prowess_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Catching_Prowess\" title=\"Soul Catching Prowess\">Soul Catching Prowess</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Snare:_Heal\" title=\"Soul Snare: Heal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Soul_Snare_Heal_Icon.webp/40px-Soul_Snare_Heal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Soul_Snare_Heal_Icon.webp/60px-Soul_Snare_Heal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Soul_Snare_Heal_Icon.webp/80px-Soul_Snare_Heal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Soul Snare: Heal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Soul_Snare_Heal_Icon.webp/40px-Soul_Snare_Heal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Soul_Snare_Heal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Snare:_Heal\" title=\"Soul Snare: Heal\">Soul Snare: Heal</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Grasp_Essence\"> Condition: Grasp Essence </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grasp_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Grasp Essence (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grasp Essence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grasp_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Grasp Essence (Condition)\">Grasp Essence</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>When you hit a creature with an unarmed attack, you can regain <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> or choose to gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> before the end of your next turn.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching\" title=\"Gloves of Soul Catching\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Soul_Catching\" title=\"Gloves of Soul Catching\">Gloves of Soul Catching</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Soul Catching has numerous errors:\n<ul><li>It states it requires an 'unarmed hit' while the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grasp_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Grasp Essence (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grasp Essence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grasp_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Grasp Essence (Condition)\">Grasp Essence</a> condition states \"hit a creature with an unarmed attack\".  Functionally, any damaging unarmed attack will trigger the effect, even against world items.</li>\n<li>It states the wielder regains <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>, but instead it grants an a free action that, when used, provides the healing.</li>\n<li>It states the wielder may gain Advantage on attack rolls <i>and</i> saving throws until the end of their next turn, while the Grasp Essence condition states the wielder may gain Advantage on attack rolls <i>or</i> saving throws before the end of their next turn.</li>\n<li>Advantage is not actually gained, but rather a free reaction is granted that provides the wielder with a choice of either adding a +5 bonus to a single attack roll or to a single saving throw, at which time the Grasp Essence condition is removed.</li>\n<li>Due to a coding error, Grasp Essence is removed from the wielder if they take damage and do not have any temporary HP.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201235\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.081 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.088 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3503/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38098/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13977/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.029/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1133029/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   74.586      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   74.586      1 -total\n 26.55%   19.801      1 Template:PageSeo\n 26.15%   19.501      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 20.38%   15.198     10 Template:Icon_text\n 19.85%   14.805      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 19.03%   14.190     42 Template:Trim\n 17.60%   13.126      2 Template:Item_icon\n 16.04%   11.962      7 Template:Icon_link\n 12.86%    9.593      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:18814-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201235 and revision id 402772. Rendering was triggered because: edit-page\n -->\n</div>"}